Troubleshooting Guide
Issue	Solution
Token creation fails	Verify admin credentials and endpoint URLs
Policy changes not applied	Restart Apache/Keystone service
Unexpected access granted	Check role assignments and policy precedence

This lab provides a comprehensive, hands-on experience with OpenStack's access control mechanisms while maintaining alignment with open-source principles and current best practices.
